      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NOD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "That is great!\\. Hopefully things will not go wrong this time.",
       "transl": "Großartig!\\. Hoffentlich läuft dieses Mal nichts schief."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...Why?",
       "transl": "... Чому?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Well...\\. it is highly unlikely that anyone would interfere again.",
       "transl": "Na ja...\\. Es ist zumindest höchst unwahrscheinlich, dass sich wieder jemand einmischt."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     null,
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Anyway, I wanted to let you know that you can \\c[3]go to sleep\\c[0] on your own now!",
       "transl": "Jedenfalls wollte ich dich wissen lassen, dass du von nun an selbst entscheiden kannst, wann du \\c[3]schlafen gehen\\c[0] willst!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...?",
       "transl": "...?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "How?",
       "transl": "Як?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ANNOYED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "It is pretty intuitive, really! ",
       "transl": "Ganz intuitiv!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "THINKING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Just go to your \\c[3]house\\c[0] in Homestedt and \\c[3]lay down in your bed\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Gehe einfach in dein \\c[3]Haus\\c[0] in Heimstatt und \\c[3]lege dich dort in dein Bett\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "There is no more need for me to be around to log you out manually.",
       "transl": "Ich muss also nicht mehr da sein, um dich manuell abzumelden."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "WHISTLING"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ASTONISHED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "And that is all I wanted to tell you.",
       "transl": "Mehr wollte ich dir nicht sagen."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "DEFAULT"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I guess now is a good time to prepare for the raid, correct?",
       "transl": "Jetzt wäre wohl ein guter Zeitpunkt, dich auf den Raid vorzubereiten, richtig?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.sergey",
       "expression": "THINKING"
      }
